## Shot preview: 640 by 400 with 64 paths through each of four subpixels. Rendered through
## tools/render.sh, which supplies Display; run from the project root.
Format 640 400 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [64]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [28]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate -0.02 0.3 5.6
Rotate -11 1 0 0
WorldBegin
Sides 2
ReadArchive "../../lights/studio.rib"
ReadArchive "../../assets/still-life/still-life.rib"
WorldEnd
